  "description": "Featuring a tig-welded steel frame & hi-tensile steel fork, the Bayside is built for casual rides around town. Front & rear caliper brakes provide great stopping power and classic cruiser tires offer terrific performance & style. A versatile 7 speed drivetrain makes hilly terrain a breeze, and the twist shifter allows for smooth & rapid gear changes at the flick of her wrist. A high rise cruiser style handlebar allows for smooth navigation while the deluxe padded saddle adds to her ride comfort. Front & rear fenders keep dirt off her clothes and she can store her stuff in the convenient handlebar mounted storage basket. Imagine your tween/teen on a summer day riding this picture perfect cruiser bike!",
